# Language Strategy

## Supported Locales (9 languages)
en, zh, ja, ko, es, fr, de, ru, tr

All new content, features, blog posts, and SEO optimizations target these 9 locales.

## Removed Locales (Sep 2026)
ar, hi, th, vi, id, pt, it

These 7 locales were removed due to near-zero organic search traffic in GSC (30-day data: all under 15 clicks). Their routing, translations (messages JSON), blog content, and sitemap entries have been fully removed.

## Implementation
- Locale list: `src/i18n/routing.ts` — authoritative locale array
- Constants: `src/lib/constants.ts` — `LOCALES` and `LOCALE_NAMES`
- Blog creation: `blog-content.mdc` — translation targets
